@title A toast fades in quietly and is fully readable once settled
@area Layout
# Polish: toasts ease in over 160 ms and out over 300 ms; the box (fill, border, shadow) fades with the text (unit test in app/motion.rs). Reduce motion shows them at full opacity at once. First picture is taken right after the toast is raised (mid-fade or settled depending on the machine), the second once settled.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text export pdf
wait 6
key Enter
wait 1
shot toast-just-raised
wait 30
shot toast-settled
check_layout
